WEBVTT

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.200
Go Onizuka, what did you do?

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:15.300
I can now see what you never will.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.270
Let me inform you.

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:22.000
Playmaker, an AI has become part of my body.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.280
What?

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:28.150
C'mon!  Don't tell me you 
implanted an AI in your brain?

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.340
Exactly.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.610
By implanting an AI in my brain, 
I have become one with an AI.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:39.760
I can now duel beyond mankind's capabilities.

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.560
Become one with an AI?

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.000
Seriously?

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:53.000
He's no longer the Go Onizuka we know.

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:15.330
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:22.120
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:29.440
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:36.010
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:42.760
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:49.990
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:56.700
I want to share your pain

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:29.640
What’s this?

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:34.610
Our company developed this 
Duel AI implant chip.

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:36.240
Implant?

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:39.360
Like it says, it's implanted in the brain.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.650
In the brain?

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:45.420
By implanting this duel chip, the 
brain’s thought capabilities expand.

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:49.150
And you can duel better than normal people.

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:53.360
Is that what you wanted to show me?

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.600
That’s right.

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.240
You're telling me I need an AI's help?

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:00.230
That chip is in the experimental phase.

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:01.700
There’s considerable risk.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:06.070
Worst case scenario, you 
won't be yourself anymore.

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:09.070
I've fulfilled my professional duties.

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:12.450
You can always refuse.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:15.110
Your methods are dirty.

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:19.610
You guide me to the gates of hell, but 
you don't care what happens afterwards.

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:22.580
I’m just an employee.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:25.320
I’ll use that chip.

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:27.200
Go Onizuka…

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:33.440
Zaizen, I've decided to become 
stronger.  No matter how.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:36.520
And you…

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:39.880
An AI in your own brain?

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.810
Exactly.

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:47.440
If I’m placed inside Go Onizuka’s 
head, I’ll become Ai Onizuka!

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:52.080
But can a human and an AI become one?

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.220
You don’t believe me.

00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:57.550
Then I’ll show you in this duel.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.340
You're quite confident.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.160
But Earth will win in the end!

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:04.630
Attack, Chimera T Wrextle!

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:13.240
Due to Gravity Vision’s effect, 
you can only attack G Golem Tokens!

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:17.510
Chimera T Wrextle’s effect.

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:24.550
When it attacks a monster in defense 
position, it deals piercing damage!

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.990
Chimera T Wrextle’s other effect.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:38.230
When it destroys a monster 
in battle, it gains 500 ATK.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:40.830
I end my turn.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:44.240
I feel my power rising!

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:45.980
There’s no doubt!

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:48.880
I’ve reached another level!

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:56.950
Earth and Water Ignis, it won't 
be difficult to capture you!

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:59.610
This human is dangerous.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:03.020
Aqua, he’s trying to hurt you.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:09.730
Aqua, it seems I must fight the humans!

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:11.830
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:14.300
Crystal Heart’s effect!

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:20.910
I Special Summon Invalid Dolmen from my 
graveyard so that it's co-linked with this monster!

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:28.450
When this effect is used, I place 
one Counter on Crystal Heart.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:35.670
The Earth monster next to its 
link gains 600 ATK per Counter!

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:40.320
Its ATK is the same as that dangerous dino!

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:43.670
Even if they'll both be destroyed, 
it’s worth destroying.

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:49.190
But due to Tyrant Dino Fusion’s effect, 
it can't be destroyed in battle once.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.140
You’re right.

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:53.740
Then I’ll crush him with power!

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.800
I summon G Golem Pebble Dog!

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:01.150
Pebble Dog’s effect activates!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:07.320
When it’s summoned, I add a 
Pebble Dog in my deck to my hand.

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:11.150
Appear!  The circuit that roars the land!

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:17.120
I set Pebble Dog and Link 3 Invalid 
Dolmen in the Link Markers!

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:23.530
Appear, Link 4 G Golem Dignified Trilithon!

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:33.210
It gains 600 ATK for each G Golem Counter!

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:37.210
It has more ATK than Onizuka’s monster!

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:39.680
I set one card!

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:44.560
Battle!  Dignified Trilithon 
attacks Chimera T Wrextle!

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.560
Trilithon’s effect activates!

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:52.300
I send an Earth monster in 
my hand to the graveyard.

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:58.910
Until the end of the turn, your monster 
loses 200 ATK, and its effects are negated!

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:03.070
I send Pebble Dog to the graveyard.

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:08.710
Including its effect, Chimera 
T Wrextle loses 700 ATK!

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:13.320
Next, Pebble Dog's effect activates 
by going to the graveyard!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:19.420
When it's sent from the hand to the 
graveyard, I add a Pebble Dog in the deck to my hand.

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:21.520
Go, Trilithon!

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:28.740
Due to Tyrant Dino Fusion’s effect, 
Chimera T Wrextle isn’t destroyed.

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:31.200
But you still take damage!

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:38.830
Next, Crystal Heart’s effect!

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:44.360
When it has two or more Counters, 
co-linked monsters can attack twice!

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:47.440
Crystal Heart’s effect!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.110
Trilithon attacks Chimera T Wrextle again!

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:05.670
So close!  Just needed a little more!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:08.680
No, I'll end it here!

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:11.820
That’s…

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:14.410
I activate my Skill, Rock You!

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:19.610
When my Earth monster destroys 
your monster in battle...

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:24.830
...you take 100 damage per the 
destroyed monster's Level!

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.840
Chimera T Wrextle is Level 8.

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:31.780
Earth wins!

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.870
This is bad, Go Onizuka!

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:47.680
In the duel, the brain's 
energy usage is maxed out!

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:50.080
Many abnormalities in the biomarkers!

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.650
It’s too dangerous to continue!

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:53.800
You lose.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:59.820
Go Onizuka lost.

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:10.100
Go Onizuka!  Are you okay?

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.040
Call the doctor!

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:16.140
I don't need a doctor!

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:30.650
Are you okay?

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:37.300
I respect your determination.  
But you're going too far!

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.590
It’s none of your business.

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:41.190
Just a little more…

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:43.700
Just a little more and I can seize it!

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.080
Go Onizuka...

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:50.940
Still, I kept losing my duels.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:54.040
Everyone thought the experiment failed.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:56.500
But I finally…

00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:58.840
You win.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:01.040
He won again!

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:04.030
Wow!  He broke the record 
for consecutive wins!

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:06.230
But what’s going on?

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:24.800
I seized it.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.440
He's at his breaking point!

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.090
Stop the experiment!

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:31.810
There’s no need for that.

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:39.260
The implant chip project will bring 
lots of money to SOL in the future.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:40.740
Queen…

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:44.220
But Go Onizuka is in great danger.

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:45.510
If he continues…

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:48.500
This is what I want.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.110
Go Onizuka!

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:52.160
My winning percentage has increased.

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:53.840
There should be no objections.

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:58.080
But you may die!

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:59.550
So what?

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:00.210
What?

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:03.320
It’s unfortunate that I can’t show you.

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:07.050
The AI is showing me a 
totally different world.

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:12.420
I can’t let go of this beautiful sight.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:16.800
I seized a new world!

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:19.020
I'll end you with this Skill!

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:21.600
Take this!  Rock You!

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:26.410
Earth wins!

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:28.180
Not yet.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:34.380
Increasing capabilities!  Brain Hack level 2!

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.280
I activate my Skill!  Anti Skill!

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:43.720
He did it!

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:50.000
No way!  My Skill was…

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:55.730
By becoming one with an AI, 
I created this new Skill!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:12:00.340
Anti Skill negates your 
Skill once during the duel!

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:04.280
And I draw two cards from my deck!

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:07.890
I end my turn!

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:10.750
A Skill that negates the 
opponent’s Skill…

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:16.750
Anti Skill…  He created a new 
Skill that never existed before.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:20.360
Seems he really has become one with an AI.

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:23.870
That’s why his appearance has changed.

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.100
Playmaker!

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.580
Blue Girl!

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:32.560
It’s the Earth Ignis and Go Onizuka.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.080
I heard what's going on.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:37.080
I don’t intend to fight you.

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:40.150
My priority is to protect the Ignis.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:44.520
But Earth wants to settle this in a duel.

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:45.990
What’s the battle status?

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.080
Earth has the advantage.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.950
But the outcome of this 
duel is still undetermined.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:54.960
Aoi, don’t do anything crazy.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:57.290
What is it?

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.060
Big trouble!  Go Onizuka is…

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:04.000
It's too taxing on his body!

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:08.720
I sealed away your Skill.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:12.280
Do you still intend to continue 
this duel, Earth Ignis?

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:13.910
Of course.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:15.680
You sealed away my Skill.

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:21.280
But you lost your ace monster 
and have few LP left!

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:25.760
I'll protect Crystal Heart and defeat you!

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:30.960
Your style…  It’s like 
looking at my past self.

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:35.200
Fine.  I’ll show you the 
difference in our powers!

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.580
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:44.630
When there are no monsters on my field, I 
Special Summon Dinowrestler Coelasilat from my hand!

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:53.650
Then due to Dinowrestler Eskrimamenchi’s 
effect, I can summon it without tributing!

00:13:54.510 --> 00:14:00.590
Level 2 Coelasilat tunes 
Level 6 Eskrimamenchi!

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:13.730
The muscular ancient king, 
kick all your enemies!

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:15.200
Synchro Summon!

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:20.190
Appear, Level 8!

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:23.860
Dinowrestler Giga Spinosavate!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:28.930
Synchro Summon?

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:32.480
First Fusion Summon, now Synchro Summon.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:34.900
Go Onizuka has evolved.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:39.230
But Earth has a monster with 4400 ATK.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.270
He can't get past that!

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:45.360
From my hand, I activate the spell 
card, Spacetime Transcendence!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.930
I banish at least two 
Dinosaurs from my graveyard.

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:51.700
I Special Summon a monster from my hand or

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.890
graveyard that equals the 
total Level of those monsters!

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:58.690
But that monster can’t attack this turn.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:03.680
I banish Level 1 Martial Ampelo 
and Level 7 Pankratops!

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:05.710
Resurrect, wild one!

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.860
Dinowrestler Chimera T Wrextle!

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:16.560
What can you do by summoning 
a monster that can’t attack?

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:20.470
Giga Spinosavate’s effect activates!

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:23.240
It destroys a monster!

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:26.210
Break apart, Crystal Heart!

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:28.870
I won’t let you!

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:30.950
Trilithon’s effect activates!

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:38.260
When your card targets a monster on my 
field, that effect is negated and destroyed!

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:40.320
Giga Spinosavate’s effect!

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:46.700
When it's destroyed in battle or by an 
effect, Chimera T Wrextle is destroyed instead.

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:52.590
The destroyed Chimera T 
Wrextle’s effect activates!

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:55.300
What's that?

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:56.880
This looks bad!

00:15:56.880 --> 00:16:03.670
When it’s destroyed by an effect, all your 
monsters in attack position are destroyed!

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:12.200
This destruction effect doesn’t target, 
so Dignified Trilithon can’t stop it.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:13.600
This is bad.

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:18.170
If he loses both his monsters, 
Earth’s field will be empty!

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:22.030
But I activate the trap, Gravity Protection!

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:27.610
By tributing one Earth monster, I 
equip it on one of my Link Monsters!

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:30.170
I tribute Trilithon!

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:34.390
And equip it on Crystal Heart!

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:40.760
While this card is equipped, Crystal Heart 
can’t be destroyed in battle or by effects.

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:46.150
And gains half of Trilithon's original ATK!

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:56.100
How’s that?  I saved it!

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:57.970
Wow!

00:16:57.970 --> 00:17:01.440
Now Giga Spinosavate can’t end him!

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:05.950
If he has Crystal Heart, he can 
resurrect the ace in his graveyard!

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:08.000
Onizuka has 100 LP left!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.680
You can win, Earth!

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:11.660
I’ll say it again and again!

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:14.290
I'll protect Crystal Heart!

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:21.270
What will Go Onizuka do in 
this hopeless situation?

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:26.530
I don't care whether you protect it or not.

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:30.730
Can you see what I see?

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.280
What?

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:34.500
Seems you can't!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:38.040
I'm a human-AI hybrid!

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:40.740
I can see a world that you can’t!

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:43.750
A world where I win the duel!

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:48.800
Battle!  Giga Spinosavate 
attacks Crystal Heart!

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:53.700
From my hand, I activate the 
Quick-Play Spell, Dino Roar!

00:17:54.100 --> 00:18:01.290
When my Dinosaur battles, I send one spell 
or trap card on your field to the graveyard!

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:05.900
I select Gravity Protection!

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:13.380
Stop!  Don’t do it!

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:17.820
This'll end it!  Giga Savate Strike!

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:22.050
This is how I duel when I’m one with an AI!

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:25.630
Don’t do it!

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:36.030
Earth!

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:44.760
I captured the Earth Ignis.

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:46.710
No way…

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.590
Earth was captured.

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:53.970
Free Earth, Go Onizuka!

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:56.560
That Ignis isn’t the enemy!

00:18:56.560 --> 00:19:00.930
I don’t care whether he's an enemy or not.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:03.040
I’m done warming up.

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.820
You’re next, Playmaker!

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:09.940
I came here to defeat you.

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:13.370
He fused with an AI to defeat Playmaker.

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:17.280
But we fought together as allies!

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.670
I don’t care about that!

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:24.340
He really has changed.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:28.550
Go Onizuka!  I’ll take you on!

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:35.980
Log him out by force!

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.890
Retrieving the Earth Ignis is priority.

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:41.520
It seems someone's butting in.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:45.630
I'll defeat you next time.  Get ready.

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:47.600
He escaped.

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:51.560
Go Onizuka, you…

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:58.990
Earth, just wait.  I promise to save you!

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:14.400
You gave us quite the trouble, Ignis.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:25.180
In order to collect data, 
we'll now dissect the Ignis.

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.640
Begin.

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:33.310
What?

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:56.770
The Ignis’s body is…

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:05.910
Stop!  I have free will!

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:08.630
